  message: "Fixed by adding _RUST_GENERIC_TRAIT_METHODS blocklist in rust.py. Generic trait methods (.into(), .clone(), .len(), .push(), etc.) are now blocked from short-name resolution via method_resolver. Fully-scoped calls (StatusRow::into()) still resolve via Strategy 1."  # 7b7e
